meta {
  name: scenarios
  seq: 11
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  End-to-end regression scenarios. Run with `bru run src/requests/scenarios --env local`
  (or as part of the full collection, after auth/). Each scenario assumes
  {{organizerToken}} is in scope from `auth/00-login.bru`.

  - manage-users/  — user lifecycle: admin creates EventOrganizers, owner self-edit,
                     role changes, disable/enable, password reset, negative-authorization
                     checks (403/404/422).
  - manage-event/  — event + guest lifecycle: create event, fill every payload
                     (locations, program, contacts, wedding top-level + 6 sub-payloads),
                     archive, then a fresh event with two guest groups, add/move/delete
                     guests, RSVP (group + single + reset), cleanup.
}
